</p><p begin="0:39.713" end="0:44.701" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.713" end="0:40.575">„Vine</span> <span begin="0:40.575" end="0:42.298">iubitul</span> <span begin="0:42.298" end="0:43.590">nostru</span> <span begin="0:43.590" end="0:44.701">Domn!</span></p><p begin="0:44.701" end="0:50.300" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.701" end="0:46.424">Se-arată</span> <span begin="0:46.424" end="0:50.300">marele-Mpărat,</span></p><p begin="0:50.300" end="0:57.808" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:50.300" end="0:50.854">Ca</span> <span begin="0:50.854" end="0:51.039">să</span> <span begin="0:51.039" end="0:52.885">refacă-al</span> <span begin="0:52.885" end="0:54.177">Său</span> <span begin="0:54.177" end="0:57.808">Regat!”</span></p><p begin="0:57.808" end="1:03.106" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.808" end="1:00.898">Rostogolindu-și</span> <span begin="1:00.898" end="1:02.223">apa</span> <span begin="1:02.223" end="1:03.106">lor</span></p><p begin="1:03.106" end="1:08.654" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.106" end="1:03.547">Prin</span> <span begin="1:03.547" end="1:04.430">munți,</span> <span begin="1:04.430" end="1:04.872">pe</span> <span begin="1:04.872" end="1:05.755">văi,</span> <span begin="1:05.755" end="1:06.196">prin</span> <span begin="1:06.196" end="1:07.079">val</span> <span begin="1:07.079" end="1:07.521">de</span> <span begin="1:07.521" end="1:08.654">mări,</span></p><p begin="1:08.654" end="1:14.393" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.654" end="1:10.419">Pâraie</span> <span begin="1:10.419" end="1:11.744">’nalță</span> <span begin="1:11.744" end="1:13.068">glasul</span> <span begin="1:13.068" end="1:14.393">lor,</span></p><p begin="1:14.393" end="1:19.499" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.393" end="1:15.276">Umplând</span> <span begin="1:15.276" end="1:17.042">văzduhul</span> <span begin="1:17.042" end="1:18.366">până-n</span> <span begin="1:18.366" end="1:19.499">zări.</span></p><p begin="1:19.499" end="1:25.238" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.499" end="